          "name": "Lunes 08:00 - Placa termina en 5 (SI circula, digito no restringido)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"placa\": \"ABC-1235\",\n  \"fechaHora\": \"2030-01-07T08:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pico-placa/verificar",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "pico-placa", "verificar"]
            },
            "description": "Lunes en franja manana pero placa termina en 5 (restringido miercoles, no lunes). Resultado: SI puede circular."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Sabado 08:00 - Cualquier placa (SI circula, fin de semana)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"placa\": \"ABC-1231\",\n  \"fechaHora\": \"2030-01-05T08:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pico-placa/verificar",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "pico-placa", "verificar"]
            },
            "description": "Sabado 05/01/2030. Los fines de semana no hay restriccion sin importar la placa ni la hora. Resultado: SI puede circular."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Domingo 08:00 - Cualquier placa (SI circula, fin de semana)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"placa\": \"ABC-1230\",\n  \"fechaHora\": \"2030-01-06T08:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pico-placa/verificar",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "pico-placa", "verificar"]
            },
            "description": "Domingo 06/01/2030. Sin restriccion. Resultado: SI puede circular."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Motocicleta - ABC-123 (SI/NO segun dia y hora)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"placa\": \"ABC-123\",\n  \"fechaHora\": \"2030-01-07T08:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pico-placa/verificar",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "pico-placa", "verificar"]
            },
            "description": "Placa de motocicleta formato LLL-NNN (3 digitos). Ultimo digito: 3. Lunes en franja manana: digito 3 no esta restringido el lunes (lunes restringe 1 y 2). Resultado: SI puede circular."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
